    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Olari liopishana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore te nkiting'oto ake ninye oo larin oopishana nichooyoyo empalakino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa nji eikununo ina palakino; ore pooki tung'ani oisilenishe nepalaa ina naisilenoko ole latia enye; meitalaku ninye to le latia enye, o to lalashe lenye, enkaraki naibalunyeki empalakinoto o Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore ilo leeiking'a indim iyie aitalaa; kake ore entoki ino naba anaa enaisilenoyie olalashe lino tapalaki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake mepuoi aata oltung'ani aisinani tiatua intae amu kelo Olaitoriani amayian intae teina kop naisho intae Olaitoriani Enkai inyi pee iyaya neaku enjung'ore inyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tenining'ining'i ake duoo intae oltoilo lo Laitoriani Enkai inyi, ning'oring'oro pee iasiasa ena kitanapata pooki naitanapa nanu intae ena olong. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu kelo Olaitoriani amayian intae anaa enaisiligie intae, naa ipuopuo intae aaisilenoki iloshon kake misilenunu intae; naa eipuopuo aaitore iloshon kumok, kake meitore ninche intae.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
